# {{name}}

A command-line program on [id_effect](https://github.com/Industrial/id_effect), generated by `id-effect new --template cli`.

```sh
cargo test
cargo run -- --token s3cr3t
cargo run -- completions bash > {{name}}.bash
```

- `src/lib.rs` — `app()`: the program as an `Effect` over a `ConfigEnv`; the token is read through `Config` and held as a `Secret` (its `Debug` prints `<redacted>`).
- `src/main.rs` — clap parses the arguments, `run_main` runs the effect: exit `0` on success, `1` on a typed failure, `101` on a defect, `130` when Ctrl-C interrupts it (finalizers run first). `completions <shell>` prints a bash, zsh, fish, elvish or PowerShell script.
- `tests/cli.rs` — the effect in process and the binary end to end.

## Run it elsewhere

- `docker compose run --rm cli --token "$API_TOKEN"` — the image from `Dockerfile`.
- `.github/workflows/ci.yml` — fmt, clippy, test and a docker build on every push.
